Mozg (VS) Code - Theme Extension
================================

1. Mozg
-------
lib/bridge.template.css restyles the webview of the "Mozg" extension
(publisher mori-ai, id mori-code) at the user's request, by editing one
stylesheet in the local installation. Mozg itself is not redistributed here.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Mozg AI; it can undo its
change at any time ("Mozg Theme: Revert Mozg Bridge").

The shape in assets/icon.png is the outline of the Mozg mark (a rounded
square, without the letter). The mark belongs to its owners.

